method.description:
Returns the oldest pending MIDI message as a [PackedByteArray] and removes it from the queue. Returns an empty array if no messages are pending.
Only works when [member use_signals] is [code]false[/code]; otherwise messages are delivered through [signal midi_message] and this method returns an empty array with an error.
[codeblock]
func _process(_delta):
    var message = midi_in.get_message()
    while not message.is_empty():
        print(message)
        message = midi_in.get_message()
[/codeblock]
